From 484f8151d8ccf9906b21b3199a41e721e301ebdd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ed <ed.bueche64@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:19:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Publish FeetechState telemetry and export opt-in
 telemetry state interfaces

Widen the per-cycle sync read to the Present_Position..Present_Current
feedback block (56-70) and decode speed, load and current as
sign-magnitude per the Feetech SDK. Expose each servo's status-packet
error byte from sync_read. Export temperature, input_voltage, current,
load and hw_state state interfaces when declared in the URDF, and
publish feetech_interfaces/FeetechState from read() with a realtime
publisher, mirroring dynamixel_hardware_interface PR #107.
